            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuti uyobole aya makani ngowalaililwa, cakubula impu nanka kampenda, mane do kubuzuba mbwayoopompa Mwami wesu Jesu Kristo. ",
